## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to translate CKNE scores into concrete GPU QoS and dynamic reallocation under bursty workloads.

## Key Concepts
- CKNE-to-resource mapping (time slices, memory budgets, preemption sensitivity)
- Real-time reallocation cadence and stability
- Burst handling, tail-latency guarantees, telemetry

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo scheduling loop (high level)
while (true) {
  tick();
  for (let t of tenants) {
    adjustBudget(t.ckne, t.currentBurst);
  }
  scheduleJobs();
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How to measure CKNE in real time with low overhead?
- How to ensure fairness across tenants with stale CKNE values?
